I handled **bookings, creator logistics, client communication and on-set coordination** across Hanoi and Hai Phong. The working constraint was to keep the brief, people, venues and schedule aligned across two cities.

Before filming, I joined client meetings, checked venues, helped plan the production timeline and briefed the team on content pillars, tone and references. On set, I coordinated talent and production needs against that brief and schedule. I tracked progress and feedback as the work moved toward delivery; the creative and production team made the videos.
